# W-AI Project Knowledge Base

## 1. Project Overview & Architecture
**Name**: W-AI
**Purpose**: Comprehensive WhatsApp Marketing & Automation Platform for E-commerce (Salla integration).
**Tech Stack**:
-   **Frontend**: Next.js 14 (App Router), React, TailwindCSS, Shadcn UI.
-   **Backend**: Convex (Real-time Database, Server Functions, Scheduling).
-   **Integrations**: WhatsApp Business API (Meta), Salla (OAuth & Data Sync).

### Key Architectural Patterns
-   **Async Webhook Handling**:
    -   **Ingestion**: [convex/http.ts](file:///Users/ahmedmansour/Documents/GitHub/w-ai/convex/http.ts) accepts webhooks and returns 200 OK immediately ("Fire-and-forget").
    -   **Dispatch**: `dispatchWebhook` mutation schedules the heavy lifting.
    -   **Processing**: `processWebhookAction` in [convex/whatsapp.ts](file:///Users/ahmedmansour/Documents/GitHub/w-ai/convex/whatsapp.ts) handles events with **retry logic** (up to 3 attempts) to handle race conditions (e.g., Read receipt arriving before Message save).
    -   **Robustness**: "Hardened Logging" is implemented to trace every payload from HTTP -> Action -> DB.
-   **Real-time Dashboard**: Uses Convex's reactive queries to update stats (Delivery Rate, Read Rate) instantly without polling.
-   **Campaign System**: Scalable design using `campaigns` table and background scheduler (pending full scale testing) to send bulk messages.

## 2. Database Schema
(Source: [convex/schema.ts](file:///Users/ahmedmansour/Documents/GitHub/w-ai/convex/schema.ts))

| Table | Description | Key Fields |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **`users`** | App users/agents | `role`, `email`, `phone` |
| **`contacts`** | Customers (synced from Salla/WA) | `phone`, `name`, `tags`, `isSubscribed` |
| **`chats`** | Conversation threads | `contactId`, `lastMessageTime`, `unreadCount` |
| **`messages`** | Chat history | `chatId`, `direction`, `type`, `status` (sent/delivered/read), `metaMessageId` (linked to WA) |
| **`templates`** | WhatsApp Templates | `name`, `status`, `components` (synced with Meta) |
| **`campaigns`** | Marketing campaigns | `templateId`, `status`, `stats` (sent/read counts) |
| **`workflows`** | Automation rules | `trigger` (e.g., keyword), `action` (e.g., send message) |
| **`sallaIntegrations`** | OAuth tokens | `accessToken`, `merchantId` |

